        "name": "OVER THE NEXT FEW CENTURIES",
        "html": "<h3 id=\"over-the-next-few-centuries\">OVER THE NEXT FEW CENTURIES</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Forest Folk sometimes petition Green Lord&#x27;s spirit for knowledge/aid • Thornthumb collects tolls from Forest Folk petitioners; his hoard grows</li>\n</ul>",
