        "html": "<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"discovery\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d6\" title=\"点击掷 1d6 — Shift: 优势 · Ctrl: 劣势\">1d6</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">发现</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1</th><td>地形变化（上一页），再掷一次</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">2</th><td>一次洞察某桩威胁或危险的机会（例如揭示数量、行踪等的踪迹）</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">3</th><td><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"useful-or-valuable-flora.html\" data-slug=\"useful-or-valuable-flora\" >有用或值钱的植物</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">4</th><td>遭遇（见下）</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">5-6</th><td>名胜（下一栏）</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
