        "html": "<h3 id=\"monsters\">怪物</h3>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>来自<strong>大森林</strong>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" >大森林</a>）的野兽，常常畸变</li><li><strong>妖精</strong>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"fae.html\" data-slug=\"fae\" >妖精</a>），尤其是以丑陋与不幸为乐的那些</li><li><strong>荒野精魂</strong>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"spirits-of-the-wild.html\" data-slug=\"spirits-of-the-wild\" >荒野精魂</a>）</li><li><strong>绿领主</strong>残余（<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"green-lords.html\" data-slug=\"green-lords\" >绿领主</a>），尤其是嵌合体和危险的增生</li><li><strong>拉穆杜尔</strong>（Llamudwr）（<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"green-lords.html\" data-slug=\"green-lords\" >绿领主</a>）</li><li>被地底之物<strong>腐化</strong>的精魂或野兽（<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-things-below.html\" data-slug=\"the-things-below\" >地底之物</a>）</li><li>死在这里、迷失而孤单之人的<strong>鬼魂</strong>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" >死亡与不死者</a>）</li><li>一头腐烂的<strong>派佩德</strong>（pyped）（<a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" >死亡与不死者</a>），靠腐肉和沼尸活着</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"stat-block\" id=\"fen-troll\">",
