        "html": "<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"why-it-incarnated\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d12\" title=\"点击掷 1d12 — Shift: 优势 · Ctrl: 劣势\">1d12</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">它为何化身</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1-2</th><td>作为惩罚/忏悔/逃避</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">3-4</th><td>因为强力魔法召唤了它</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">5-6</th><td>为了追求某项议程</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">7-8</th><td>出于好奇/无聊/绝望</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">9-10</th><td>经由命运或宇宙意外</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">11-12</th><td>为了学习，为了体验世界</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
